# goat-capabilities-verify project ontology — deliberately empty of individuals.
#
# goat-capabilities-pack's own ontology.ttl is a complete, closed model of
# the AzureGoat/TerraGoat gc:AttackStep/gc:Finding individuals; this
# consumer adds no project-specific facts on top of it (mirrors
# examples/rmcp-verify/schema/domain.ttl's same posture). This file exists
# only to satisfy [ontology] source in ggen.toml — the real domain facts
# come entirely from the wired pack.

@prefix gc:   <http://seanchatmangpt.github.io/packs/goat-capabilities#> .
@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
